# Sanctioned swatches for THIS manual project — one swatch name per line.
# Convention: this file lives next to the build dir as "<dir>.swatches"
# (so it stays OUT of the packed .idml). Override with --swatches PATH.
#
#  * These names are KEPT by prune_swatches.py even if currently unused
#    (the sanctioned palette a manual is allowed to draw from).
#  * validate_idml.py FLAGS any applied color whose name is not in this list
#    (structural None / Paper / Registration / $ID-managed are always allowed).
#
# DM32 house rule: Black + up to 3 spot colors, never more. Black is mandatory.
Black
PANTONE 292 U
PANTONE 130 U
PANTONE Warm Gray 1 U
